	// use and useRelation: fallow credits no member called through a property of a union-typed value, and the checker
	// calls ParamCell's on the cell of a BindValue (check/checker.ts). The report and when these entries go are in
	// upstream/fallow-unused-class-member-union-property. release: fallow does not type a for-of binding, and
	// SessionPool.release calls SessionStatements.release on each open session it iterates in adapter/wire/session.ts
	// makePool. member and nestedRows: the union again, WriteParams.member and WriteParams.nestedRows called on the
	// params of a StatementPlaceholders (lower/conservative/context.ts). retype, scalar and relation: fallow does not follow an interface to its classes,
	// and the lowering calls StatementParams' through the Placeholders that LowerContext.params returns. _tag:
	// KeyConflict's tag, read through the error unions that discriminate on it. matches: the interface again, and the
	// evaluator calls PatternReads.matches on the CompilePatterns or ProgramPatterns its caller passes
	// (scalar/compute/evaluate.ts, a Compute.matches). discriminantSpine: fallow does not type a callback's parameter
	// from the type it is passed as, and the simplifier's rules call DagEditor.discriminantSpine on the editor of the cx
	// each Rule's at receives (lower/optimize/simplify/rules.ts). freshVar, freshOccurrence and freshScope: fallow does
	// not follow a class's property to its type, and the catalog shapes call CatalogEditor's through CatalogContext.ed
	// (lower/shapes/catalog/neighbor.ts). folds, fold and axes, only of the class that implements RiddenFamily: fallow
	// reads FamilyEntry's as unused, though the Normalizer reads all three through its Map of FamilyEntry
	// (analysis/theory/laws.ts). The entry goes when fallow is patched (TODO.md, grizzle/upstream/fallow).
	"usedClassMembers": [
		{ "implements": "RiddenFamily", "members": ["folds", "fold", "axes"] },
		"discriminantSpine",
		"use",
		"useRelation",
		"freshVar",
		"freshOccurrence",
		"freshScope",
		"release",
		"retype",
		"scalar",
		"relation",
